# Language policy

- **Skills** (`skills/**`) and **repository documentation** (README, CATALOG, PROVENANCE, LICENSING, forge `references/*.md`, etc.): write in **English**.
- **Generated reports** (`reports/**`) and **delivery / Cursor plans**: write in **Brazilian Portuguese (PT-BR)**.
- **Chat with the user**: Brazilian Portuguese (PT-BR) unless they ask otherwise.
- Skill content, identifiers, and code remain English even when the chat is PT-BR.
